@startuml
title 4. Token refresh (rotation)
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Auth
database Redis

Client -> Gateway : POST /auth/refresh { refreshToken }
Gateway -> Auth : route
Auth -> Redis : lookup refresh jti
alt missing / expired / reused
    Auth -> Redis : revoke token family (reuse detection)
    Auth --> Client : 401 (re-login required)
else valid
    Auth -> Redis : delete old refresh (rotate)
    Auth -> Redis : store new refresh jti
    Auth -> Auth : mint new access JWT
    Auth --> Client : 200 { accessToken, refreshToken }
end
@enduml
